\ Fixture for own_module_image_param_compiled. Exports `probe` under the same
\ name as the sibling B fixture, plus a parameter whose default has no nested
\ definition, the shape the freeze-compiled-default bug report exercised. The
\ default is never compiled at freeze; it runs interpreted inside the runtime
\ image under the loader's module stamp and must resolve this module's `probe`.

probe: ( -- str ) [ "A-PROBE" ] ;

a-param: parameter{ [ probe ] } ;
